        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22.1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ch 21.37 in Heb",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “If a man steals an ox or a sheep, and kills it or sells it, he shall pay five oxen for an ox, and four sheep for a sheep.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22.1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Restoring the second half of verse 3 and the whole of verse 4 to their place immediately following verse 1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " He shall make restitution; if he has nothing, then he shall be sold for his theft. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " If the stolen beast is found alive in his possession, whether it is an ox or an ass or a sheep, he shall pay double.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
