          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22.3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ch 22.1 in Heb",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “If a thief is found breaking in, and is struck so that he dies, there shall be no bloodguilt for him; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " but if the sun has risen upon him, there shall be bloodguilt for him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
